<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-EVEA PANK WILL NOT MAKE DIVIDEND PAYMENTS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-EVEA PANK WILL NOT MAKE DIVIDEND PAYMENTS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian commercial bank Evea Pank, quoted on the secondary list of the stock exchange, said on Thursday it will keep all its profits in the company and not distribute any of them as dividends.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement that most of the 1996 profit of 9.9 million kroons will be put into the company's reserves and the rest will be stay undistributed.</p>
<p>The group said these proposals would be put to shareholders at a meeting on March 26.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
